SUMMARY:NJ4S Morris-Sussex Color Blast Fun Run/Walk
DESCRIPTION:More color. More fun. More memories!\nOur 2nd annual NJ4S Morris-Sussex Color Blast Fun Run/Walk will feature additional color stations along the route\, so you’ll cross the finish line brighter than ever!\nJoin us for the FREE event this fall in partnership with Vernon Township High School/Vernon Township School District and Psi Alpha AP Psychology Students.\n\n \nSaturday\, September 26\, 2026\nRegistration: 9:00am | Run/Walk: 10:00-11:30am\nVernon Township High School\, 1832 County Road 565\, Glenwood\, NJ \n \nThis NO COST community event will be filled with:  Music |  Games |  Crafts |  T-Shirt Decorating \n\nREGISTER to attend! \n  \n\nIn partnership with MHA\, NJ4S Morris-Sussex is providing white t-shirts for the color blast to those who bring a non-perishable food item or shampoo\, conditioner or deodorant to support The Weekend Bag Program\, Inc. Learn more: weekendbagprogram.org\n\n 
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/7972/
LOCATION:Vernon Township High School\, 1832 County Road 565\, Glenwood\, NJ\, 07418\, United States
CATEGORIES:NJ4S
END:VEVENT
